1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Hot take: don't climb Huangshan in summer.
I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,200
Everyone rushes up for the summer sunrise. Wrong season.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,800
The sea of clouds you came for peaks November to May.

4
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,200
Huangshan sits in cloud around 200 days a year.

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,800
Summer brings heat, haze, and the year's biggest crowds.

6
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,000
In summer you book the mountain hotels months ahead.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,400
Double-tap if you'd brave the cold for empty trails.

8
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,000
Go late autumn or winter — cloud seas, bare granite, nobody.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,200
★ Expert Tip: watch for rain then a clearing — that's when clouds flood the valleys.

10
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,800
Summer sunrise or winter cloud sea — which would you pick?
